  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Bob Lazar, a man who says he worked on alien craft at a secret Nevada site he calls S-4, says that in 1989, while his security clearance was being checked, he was followed in Las Vegas: \"There was always somebody parked outside my house and I was starting to get scared.\" He tells Michels he confided this to a friend named Gene Huff. He tells it as part of how the pressure on him grew before he went public."
